    "### Analysis Point 1: Daily Commute Peak Analysis\n",
    "Measure Rented Bike Count across Hour (0–23) to quantify morning rush (8:00–9:00 AM) and evening rush (6:00–8:00 PM) spikes versus nighttime minima."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 55,
   "id": "2f1856c4",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "image/png": "",
