    "#### Analysis Point 2: Weekday vs. Weekend Commute Profile Shifts \n",
    "Parse Date into weekdays and weekends to evaluate how hourly demand flattens and shifts toward mid-afternoon on non-working days."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 56,
