    "#### Analysis Point 4: Holiday Impact Analysis\n",
    "Compare average hourly rental curves between Holiday (\"Holiday\" vs. \"No Holiday\") status to identify non-commuter leisure biking patterns."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 58,
